---
// CapabilitiesSection.astro - Clean Capabilities Section (wateremoval.com inspired)
---

<section class="capabilities-section py-section" id="capabilitiesSection">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="capabilities-grid">
      
      <!-- Left Column: Copy & 7 Points -->
      <div class="capabilities-copy">
        <h2 class="section-title">
          One Team for Extraction, Drying, Cleanup, and Restoration
        </h2>

        <p class="section-desc" style="margin-bottom: 14px;">
          When your property is damaged by water, you need more than a quick cleanup. You need a clear path back to normal.
        </p>

        <p class="capabilities-lead-text">
          ER Emergency Restoration provides comprehensive water damage restoration, including:
        </p>

        <div class="capabilities-list">
          <div class="cap-item">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-red"></i>
            <span>Thorough assessment of the source and extent of water damage</span>
          </div>
          <div class="cap-item">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-red"></i>
            <span>Rapid water extraction</span>
          </div>
          <div class="cap-item">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-red"></i>
            <span>Drying for affected walls, floors, and carpets</span>
          </div>
          <div class="cap-item">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-red"></i>
            <span>Moisture monitoring for affected areas</span>
          </div>
          <div class="cap-item">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-red"></i>
            <span>Mold-conscious cleanup and remediation support when needed</span>
          </div>
          <div class="cap-item">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-red"></i>
            <span>Repair and restoration after the affected areas are addressed</span>
          </div>
          <div class="cap-item">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-red"></i>
            <span>Clear documentation of the damage and restoration process</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
          <a href="#heroLeadFormCard" class="btn-red">
            <span>Request My Free Water Damage Quote</span>
            <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Authentic Restoration Photo -->
      <div class="capabilities-img-col">
        <div class="img-frame">
          <img 
            src="/assets/images/photos/er-emergency-response-team.webp" 
            alt="One Team for Extraction, Drying, Cleanup, and Restoration - ER Emergency Restoration" 
            class="feature-img"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .capabilities-section {
    position: relative;
    padding: 80px 0;
    background-color: #F8F9FA;
    background-image: url('/assets/images/er/er-emergency-back.webp');
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center;
    background-repeat: no-repeat;
    border-top: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
  }

  .capabilities-lead-text {
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #0C2340;
    font-size: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .capabilities-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 0.85fr;
    gap: 50px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .capabilities-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .cap-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 12px;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #1E293B;
  }
  .cap-item i {
    font-size: 18px;
    margin-top: 2px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .img-frame {
    border-radius: 18px;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(12, 35, 64, 0.1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(226, 232, 240, 0.9);
    background-color: #FFFFFF;
  }
  .feature-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 460px;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }

  @media (max-width: 991px) {
    .capabilities-section {
      padding: 50px 0;
    }
    .capabilities-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 30px;
    }
    .feature-img {
      height: 320px;
    }
  }
</style>
